    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/",
    "note": "Skeleton_Warrior.glb from the pack's GitHub mirror, pinned to commit 15b62b9 (LICENSE.txt: CC0, Kay Lousberg); the gradient atlas is embedded in the GLB. Unlike the Adventurers rigs, this GLB carries no weapons: the pack ships them as separate asset files, so Skeleton_Blade.gltf and Skeleton_Shield_Small_A.gltf (same commit, with their .bin files and skeleton_texture.png) are attached with ingest.attach to handslot.r and handslot.l. 26 of 95 clips kept (1H melee set, block, hits, deaths, the skeleton-only shamble, collapse/resurrect and awaken/spawn clips, taunt, cheer, sit; ranged, 2H, dual-wield, spellcast, lie-down and pose clips dropped). death is Death_A; Death_C_Skeletons (falls apart: the body tumbles about 1.5 m back and one leg is left standing, as authored) and Death_C_Skeletons_Resurrect stay under their own names. Height 1.6 m like the KayKit knight: KayKit characters are chibi (head about a third of the body), so 1.6 m keeps the helmeted skull near a real head size. Colours: the bones stay bone-white as the main read; the grey iron armour and helmet go navy (sky over near-black); the blade is pale steel (moon over near-black) so it reads apart from the navy armour in both tones; the shield has a steel rim and an amber wooden face."
  },
